  "solution": "**Logic: [First no.] : [(First no.)²] : [(First no.)² ÷ 2]**\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**(1)** 20 : 400 : 200 →\n\n⇒ [20] : [(20)²] : [(20)² ÷ 2]\n\n**(2) **9 : 81 : 45 →\n\n⇒ [9] : [(9)2] : [{(9)2 + 9} ÷ 2]\n\n**(3)** 13 : 169 : 84.5 →\n\n⇒ [13] : [(13)2] : [(13)2 ÷ 2]\n\n**(4)** 25 : 625 : 312.5 →\n\n⇒ [25] : [(25)2] : [(25)2 ÷ 2]\n\nHere, **'9 : 81 : 45'** is different from the rest.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
